              <div class="card">
                <div class="card-header">
                  <h3 class="card-title">PETSYNC</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                  <div id="accordion">
                    <div class="card card-primary">
                      <div class="card-header">
                        <h4 class="card-title">
                          <a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapseOne">
                            About Us
                          </a>
                        </h4>
                      </div>
                      <div id="collapseOne" class="panel-collapse collapse in">
                        <div class="card-body">
                          Welcome to PETSYNC Social Community! We are dedicated to connecting pet lovers from around the world. Whether you're a pet owner, enthusiast, or simply love animals, you'll find a vibrant community here to share stories, tips, and photos of our beloved pets.
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card card-danger">
                      <div class="card-header">
                        <h4 class="card-title">
                          <a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapseTwo">
                            Community Guidelines
                          </a>
                        </h4>
                      </div>
                      <div id="collapseTwo" class="panel-collapse collapse">
                        <div class="card-body">
                          To ensure a positive and respectful environment for all members, please review our Community Guidelines. These guidelines outline the expected behavior within our community, including interactions with other members, posting content, and respecting diversity and inclusivity.
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card card-success">
                      <div class="card-header">
                        <h4 class="card-title">
                          <a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapseThree">
                            Get Involved
                          </a>
                        </h4>
                      </div>
                      <div id="collapseThree" class="panel-collapse collapse">
                        <div class="card-body">
                          Ready to start engaging with our community? Explore our discussion forums, share photos and stories of your pets, participate in events and contests, and connect with fellow pet lovers from around the globe. Join PETSYNC Social Community today and let's celebrate our love for pets together!
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- /.card-body -->
